.TH tkufilterbar n 0.40.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkufilterbar \- per-column filter bar
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkufilterbar
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkufilterbar::widget .f -command cmd]
.br
::tkutils::tkufilterbar::setColumns $w {col1 col2 ...}
.SH DESCRIPTION
A row of small labelled entries, one per column. Each field filters its own
column; the consumer ANDs the non-empty fields together. \-command is called as
"cmd filters", where filters is a dict {column -> text} of the non-empty fields.
Call setColumns to (re)build the row for a new set of columns. Complements
tkusearchbar (a single free-text box). See docs/tkufilterbar.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkusearchbar(n), tkutils::tkutablelist(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, filter, column
